.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 

.SS "template<uint32_t dim>
.br
class csmp::ExplicitFiniteVolumeTransportPHX< dim >"Finitive volume calculations for one phase within the CVFEM scheme (Weis et al\&., Geofluids, 2014)\&.

.PP
\fBAuthor\fP
.RS 4
Philipp Weis, ETH Zuerich 
.RE
.PP
.SH "Contact"
.PP
philipp.weis@erdw.ethz.ch

.PP
@changes changes Latest Changes
.SH "Motivation"
.PP
Specialized version of explicit finite volume transport class for PHX scheme\&.
.SH "Usage"
.PP
To be used within the CVFEM scheme (Weis et al\&., Geofluids, 2014)\&.

.PP
.PP
.nf
Performs mass balanced finite volume tansport
.fi
.PP
.SH "Dependencies"
.PP
The functions are tailored for use in \fBTwoPhaseTransportPHX\fP\&. Needs \fBStencilProcessorPHX\fP
.SH "Known issues"
.PP
.SH "Testing"
.PP
testing was done in the period before publication in 2014\&. 
